---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="404 · 陶然">
  <main>
    <div class="pot" aria-hidden="true">
      {/* M5 替换为可拖拽拼回的物理碎陶罐（docs/08-webgpu.md §3.3） */}
      <span class="shard s1"></span>
      <span class="shard s2"></span>
      <span class="shard s3"></span>
    </div>
    <h1>404 · 陶罐摔碎了</h1>
    <p>这页泥还没捏，或者已经回炉了。</p>
    <p class="cta">
      <a class="clay-btn" data-variant="primary" href="/">回首页</a>
      <button class="clay-btn" data-variant="soft" type="button" data-open-search>搜一搜</button>
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  main {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  h1 {
    color: var(--clay-primary-deep);
  }
  .cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .cta .clay-btn {
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .pot {
    position: relative;
    height: 120px;
  }
  .shard {
    position: absolute;
    background: var(--clay-primary);
    box-shadow: var(--clay-elev-rest);
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
  }
  .s1 {
    width: 70px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 45% 55% 60% 40% / 50% 45% 55% 50%;
    translate: -90px -20px;
    rotate: -14deg;
  }
  .s2 {
    width: 88px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 55% 45% 40% 60% / 45% 55% 45% 55%;
    translate: -30px -36px;
    rotate: 6deg;
  }
  .s3 {
    width: 60px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50% 50% 65% 35% / 55% 45% 55% 45%;
    translate: 50px -14px;
    rotate: 18deg;
  }
</style>
